f&oh=00_AQKRl4s7dlb7ZH34YEhjimy3U_1B7V7-bZZVJK6eSQH4dA&oe=6A9980F7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cycle X VR", "keywords": ["Bike", "Cycle", "Fitness", "Racing", "Sports"], "long_description": "CYCLE X VR \u2014 ARCADE BIKE RACING FOR META QUEST\n\nRace through neon-lit tracks, dodge flying obstacles, and blast through boost gates \u2014 all locked to a pulse-pounding beat. Cycle X VR is a high-speed arcade cycling game built from the ground up for Meta Quest, fusing VR bike racing with rhythm-based gameplay and genuine calorie-burning intensity.\n\nIf you love Beat Saber but crave speed, this is your next obsession. Every corner, every sprint, every near-miss hits harder in full VR immersion. Standalone. No PC. No cables. Just ride.\n\nFEATURES\n- High-speed arcade bike racing for Meta Quest 2, Quest 3 and Quest 3S\n- Rhythm-synced obstacle courses where timing wins races\n- Multiple tracks, worlds and difficulty levels\n- Global leaderboard \u2014 beat your ghost or the world\n- Real VR fitness workout that never feels like one\n- Smooth locomotion optimized to minimize motion sickness\n\nBURN CALORIES. BREAK RECORDS.\nVR cycling is proven to reduce perceived effort \u2014 you push harder without noticing. Sessions are physically demanding, sweat-inducing and genuinely addictive. This is your cardio, leveled up.\n\nMount up. The track is live.", "short_description": "High-speed VR bike racing meets rhythm gameplay. Dodge, dash & dominate on adrenaline-fueled tracks. The most intense cycle game on Meta Quest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Gravity Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": 